From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 44/47] PC5: a smaller display mode is shown where Wine draws
 it (Wine patch 0932)

Wine maps a display mode smaller than the desktop about the desktop's
centre, but the PS5 driver showed it, and stopped the pointer, from the
top left. A game that follows the system's pointer could reach only
part of its width: Sacred Underworld at 1024x768, about five sixths.
---
